Torc-Lite — Authorship and Acknowledgments
=========================================

SOFTWARE AUTHOR AND SOLE CODE DEVELOPER

Panagiotis E. Hadjidoukas
CEID-HPCLAB, University of Patras, Greece

Panagiotis E. Hadjidoukas is the original author, sole code developer,
and current maintainer of Torc-Lite.

ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

Yaser Afshar (University of Michigan, as credited in the original AUTHORS
file) tested the library and provided feedback and suggestions for
improvements. Related changes he developed in his own separate GitHub
repository are not code contributions to this Torc-Lite repository.

PUBLICATION AUTHORSHIP

The original TORC research publication was written by Panagiotis E.
Hadjidoukas, Evaggelos Lappas, and Vassilios V. Dimakopoulos.
Publication authorship should not be confused with Torc-Lite code authorship.

For citation metadata, see CITATION.cff. For related scientific
publications, see the README.
